  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "溝通與談判技巧",
    "sub_ename": "COMMUNICATION AND NEGOTIATION SKILL",
    "describe_ch": "談判是一門藝術，它必須透過心領神會之後，再創新，進而將之運用於各種不同的情勢，包括從私人事務到公共事務中各種矛盾衝突的解決。本課程採取講述方式與課堂討論，期末分組針對自選議題，提出談判規劃與實際談判。",
    "describe_eh": "Negotiation is an art that must be learned by heart and then innovated and applied to a variety of situations, from private to public affairs, to resolve conflicts. This course is based on lecture and classroom discussion, and at the end of the course, groups are divided to propose negotiation plans and actual negotiations on issues of their choice.",
